          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fractions in Disguise"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.088,
            0.847,
            0.129
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 10:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " A TV is bought at a price of ₹21,000. After 1 year, the value of the TV depreciates by 5%. Find the value of the TV after one year."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.144,
            0.494,
            0.198
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The amount of reduction in the value is 5% of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\begin{array} { r } { 2 1 \\mathrm { , } 0 0 0 = 0 . 0 5 \\times 2 1 \\mathrm { , } 0 0 0 } \\\\ { = 1 0 5 0 . } \\end{array}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.199,
            0.487,
            0.237
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The current value is 21,000 – 1050 = 19,950."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.505,
            0.143,
            0.856,
            0.221
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The value of the TV after 1 year will be 95% of the current value = 95% of 21,000 = 0.95 × 21,000 = 19,950."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.246,
            0.615,
            0.267
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The value of the TV after 1 year will be ₹19,950."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.276,
            0.847,
            0.335
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 11:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " The population of a village was observed to be reducing by about 10% every decade. If the current population is 1250, what is the expected population after 3 decades?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.351,
            0.473,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The population 1 decade later will be 0.9 times the population of the current decade."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.138,
            0.406,
            0.445,
            0.443
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore, the population after 1 decade will be 1250 × 0.9."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.443,
            0.483,
            0.479
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The population after 2 decades will be 1250 × 0.9 × 0.9."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.48,
            0.483,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The population after 3 decades will be "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\begin{array} { c } { { 1 \\bar { 2 } 5 \\bar { 0 } \\times 0 . 9 \\times 0 . 9 \\times 0 . 9 } } \\\\ { { = 9 1 1 . 2 5 . } } \\end{array}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.497,
            0.35,
            0.841,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "First decade’s decrease = 0.1 × 1250 = 125."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.497,
            0.387,
            0.778,
            0.424
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_24_equation_12.jpg",
          "content": "\\mathrm { P o p u l a t i o n ~ a f t e r ~ 1 ~ d e c a d e } = 1 2 5 0 - 1 2 5 = 1 1 2 5 ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.497,
            0.424,
            0.752,
            0.443
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Second decade’s decrease"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.497,
            0.461,
            0.776,
            0.498
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_24_equation_14.jpg",
          "content": "\\mathrm { P o p u l a t i o n ~ a f t e r ~ 2 ~ d \\acute { e } c a d e s } \\atop = 1 1 2 5 - 1 1 2 = 1 0 1 3"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.497,
            0.498,
            0.844,
            0.534
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Third decade’s population decrease = 0.1 × 1013 = 101.3 ≅ 101."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.497,
            0.535,
            0.771,
            0.572
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Population after 3 decades = 1013 – 101 = 912."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.578,
            0.846,
            0.617
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Rounding off, we can say that the expected population after 3 decades will be around 910."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.632,
            0.389,
            0.654
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Tricky Percentages"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
