          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.693,
            0.749,
            0.731
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ You have won a contest. The organisers offer you two options to choose from:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.731,
            0.642,
            0.751
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Option A: You deposit ₹100 and you get back ₹300."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.75,
            0.663,
            0.769
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Option B: You deposit ₹1000 and you get back ₹1500."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.768,
            0.804,
            0.808
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What is the percentage gain each option gives? You can choose any option only once. Which option would you choose? Why?"
            }
          ]
